Package: s3duck
Version: _version_
Architecture: _arch_
Maintainer: Vladislav Ananev <nexus.riot@gmail.com>
Description:Simple Opensource cross-platform client for Simple Storage Service.
 Every entry in Depends is imported directly by the app, except
 python3-pyqt6.qtsvg, which Qt needs as an image plugin to render the bundled
 SVG icons at all: without it QIcon loads an .svg into a non-null icon that
 paints nothing, so toolbar buttons come out blank.
Installed-Size: _size_
Depends: python3 (>=3.6), python3-boto3, python3-botocore, python3-cryptography, python3-urllib3, python3-pyqt6, python3-pyqt6.sip, python3-pyqt6.qtsvg, python3-pyqt6.qtpdf
